  W1 rolling-origin (2015-25, n=169): MAE shrunk - MAE k=1 = -0.029 [-0.08,+0.03] p=0.28  -> keep k=1.0 (no Week-1 shrink of the rating line)
  W1 slope of margin on preseason rating gap = 1.17 (se 0.20), n=253: regressed preseason Elo is not over-confident

=== 2. MARKET / CONTEXT INFORMATION IN WEEK 1 (Theory 1 + caps) ===
  info share of market deviation from ratings: other weeks 0.93 (se 0.07), W1 0.41 (change -0.52, se 0.35, p=0.144), n=4059
  same for W1-4 vs W5+: W5+ 0.97, W1-4 0.58 (change -0.40, se 0.18, p=0.028)
